{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33057","headline":"代谢玄晖新亭送范零陵 · 曹邺","name":"代谢玄晖新亭送范零陵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚水洪无际，沧茫接天涯。\n相看不能语，独鸟下江蓠。\n蓬子悉有恋，蓬根却无期。\n车轮自不住，何必怨路岐。\n孟冬衣食薄，梦寐亦未遗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33057.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33057","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}